{"kind":"stack","id":"s-plants","title":"Parts of a flowering plant: roots, stem, leaves and flowers","theme":{"background":"#f4f9ef","foreground":"#1f3b1a","font":"Georgia, serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c1-t","content":"Roots"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-d","content":"Roots hold the plant in the soil and soak up water and minerals."},{"type":"button","id":"c1-n","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-t","content":"Stem"},{"type":"text","id":"c2-d","content":"The stem carries water up to the leaves and flowers and holds them up to the light."},{"type":"button","id":"c2-n","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"image","id":"c3-p","picto":"sun"},{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"What do leaves mostly use to make food for the plant?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"Sunlight","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"Sunlight and air","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"Soil only","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-q","content":"Which part of the plant anchors it in the ground?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"Leaves","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"Roots","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-c","label":"Flowers","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-d","label":"Seeds","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c5-q","content":"What is the main job of a flower?"},{"type":"button","id":"c5-a","label":"To hold up the plant","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"To soak up water","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-c","label":"To make seeds","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"image","id":"c6-p","picto":"map"},{"type":"text","id":"c6-q","content":"You find a plant with broken roots. Do you water it at the top or dig to check the roots?"},{"type":"button","id":"c6-a","label":"Water the leaves","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c6-b","label":"Dig to check the roots","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-t","content":"The leaves get water, but the roots cannot drink it. The plant droops. Remember, roots take in water from the soil."},{"type":"button","id":"c7-n","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-t","content":"You gently check the soil and find the roots. You repair them and the plant starts to stand up straight again."},{"type":"button","id":"c8-n","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-q","content":"Which part of the plant carries water up from the roots?"},{"type":"button","id":"c9-a","label":"The stem","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-b","label":"The flower","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-c","label":"The seed","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c10","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c10-h","content":"You finished the plant parts quiz!"},{"type":"text","id":"c10-m","content":"Roots hold and drink, the stem carries, leaves make food, and flowers make seeds. Well done."}],"actions":[]}}
